# Reviewed exceptions for tests/log_hygiene.rs (WS12.S6).
#
# One entry per site, three fields separated by TABS:
#   <path relative to crates/, for example quarry-runtime/src/x.rs>
#   <the trimmed source line that holds the banned token>
#   <the reason: why the value is not page or caller text>
#
# A reason is mandatory. An entry that matches no violation fails the test.
# Prefer a `// zdr-log-ok: <reason>` comment on the macro line (or the line
# above it) over an entry here: the comment sits next to the code it excuses.
# The list is empty: every site the lint found is fixed or carries a reasoned
# zdr-log-ok comment.
